    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d647-a7-a2">

                <pb facs="0804" n="694" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg694"/>

                <p>The consul of Italy here would like to know if the name of Pietro Monastero
                    appears on the passenger list of the Italian steamer <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Plata</hi>, which arrived in January, 1890; also if the name of Marchesi or
                    Grimando appears on the list of passengers arrived on the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Plata</hi> in November, 1888 or 1889.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Papini</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of Consulate</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Custom-House, Record Room</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                    ><placeName>New Orleans, La.</placeName></hi>, <date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1891-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >April, 17, 1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                    <p>I hereby certify that the foregoing is a true copy of the application on file
                        in this office.</p>
                    <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. G. Johnson</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Record Clerk</hi>.</signed></closer>
                </postscript>
                <postscript>
                    <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Custom-House., Port of New Orleans</hi>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                                when="1891-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                            1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                    <p>Approved as correct, etc.</p>
                    <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal</hi>.] <signed><hi
                                rendition="#small-caps">F. Z. Eushm</hi>, (?)<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Special Deputy Collector</hi>.</signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
